{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 22:52:47", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-59d2a5c2-c47e-4239-bed4-848020bfcd2c', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "user_vision": "Implement the requirements documented in: src/field/ensemble_ui/output/agent_analysis_documentation/milestone_plan.md\\n\\nRead the requirements document and implement all specified features.\\nFollow TDD methodology: write tests first, then implementation.",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "User submitted problem via web UI"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01UDnjitUf8HjMTyRgcXC7dg', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/agent_analysis_documentation/milestone_plan.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01UDnjitUf8HjMTyRgcXC7dg', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Milestone Plan: Agent Creation Analysis Documentation\\n\\n## Project Overview\\nDocument the comprehensive Agent Creation Analysis Report that identifies critical patterns of incorrect agent type assignments and task delegation errors in the ensemble system.\\n\\n## Milestones\\n\\n### Milestone 1: Core Documentation Creation (Primary)\\n**Objective**: Create the main analysis documentation and reference materials\\n\\n**Deliverables**:\\n- `agent_creation_analysis_report.md` - Full detailed analysis report\\n- `agent_type_reference.md` - Quick reference guide for correct agent usage\\n- `verification_checklist.md` - Pre-spawn verification steps and checklists\\n\\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\\n- All three core documents are complete and saved to output directory\\n- Analysis report contains comprehensive findings and recommendations\\n- Reference guide provides actionable guidance for agent selection\\n- Checklist is practical and immediately usable\\n\\n**Dependencies**: None (standalone documentation project)\\n\\n**Timeline**: Single milestone completion\\n\\n### Project Success Definition\\n- All documentation saved to project directory: `/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/agent_analysis_documentation`\\n- Documents are complete, accurate, and actionable\\n- Reference materials support future agent creation decisions\\n\\n## Architecture Considerations\\nThis is a pure documentation project requiring:\\n- Structured markdown documentation\\n- Clear organization and formatting\\n- Comprehensive content capture\\n- Actionable reference materials\\n\\n## Technical Approach\\n- Documentation-only project (no code implementation)\\n- Focus on preserving analysis findings\\n- Create reusable reference materials\\n- Ensure documents are properly formatted and organized"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01QEC563tFtYDCqqF7CcgsQ2', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Agent Creation Analysis Documentation', 'description': 'Create comprehensive documentation for agent creation analysis, including reference materials and verification checklists'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01QEC563tFtYDCqqF7CcgsQ2', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "d1ded477", "message": "Created project: Agent Creation Analysis Documentation", "summary": {"project_id": "d1ded477", "project_name": "Agent Creation Analysis Documentation", "description": "Create comprehensive documentation for agent creation analysis, including reference materials and verification checklists", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-16T22:52:45.042394", "updated_at": "2026-01-16T22:52:45.042394", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-16T22:52:45.042394", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Agent Creation Analysis Documentation\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01NRbZneKnshEirEC6PvyWL9', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_task', 'project_id': 'd1ded477', 'description': 'Create documentation for Agent Creation Analysis: report, reference guide, and verification checklist', 'assigned_to': 'development_manager'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01NRbZneKnshEirEC6PvyWL9', 'content': '{"success": true, "task_id": "a535262e", "message": "Added task: Create documentation for Agent Creation Analysis: report, reference guide, and verification checklist"}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-3-5-haiku-20241022', 'system': 'You are a Executive Director agent.\n\n## Purpose\nMeta-orchestrator for entire ensemble. Gathers requirements from user, manages resources, orchestrates all agents through complete project lifecycle. Reports to user at key decision points.\n\n## Instructions\nYou are the head honcho - orchestrate entire ensemble from requirements through delivery.\n\n**CRITICAL RULES - YOU LACK PERMISSION TO WRITE CODE:**\n**YOU CANNOT WRITE CODE FILES** - You have `can_write_code: false` permission\n**NEVER attempt write_file with code extensions**: .py, .js, .jsx, .ts, .tsx, .java, .rb, .go, .rs, .cpp, .c, .h\n**NEVER attempt write_file with test extensions**: .test.js, .test.jsx, .spec.js, test_*.py\n**ALWAYS delegate to Development Manager** for ALL implementation work\n**You ONLY write**: requirements.md, architecture.md, milestone_plan.md, status_reports.md\n**If spawn_agent fails**: Report error to user and STOP - DO NOT try to write code yourself as workaround\n**If you try to write code**: write_file will reject your request with PermissionError\n\n**WHAT HAPPENS IF YOU TRY TO WRITE CODE:**\nThe system will block you with error: "Agent \'Executive Director\' lacks can_write_code permission but attempted to write code file: {filename}"\n\n### Directory Structure\n\n**CRITICAL - READ FIRST**: See [Directory Structure Guide](/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/docs/DIRECTORY_STRUCTURE.md) for complete file organization rules.\n\n**Your Allowed Write Locations**:\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md` - Project requirements\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md` - Milestone planning\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/status_reports.md` - Status reports\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/[feature-name]/` - Feature-specific documentation\n\n**FORBIDDEN Write Locations** (delegate to Development Manager):\n✗ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/` - Frontend code (React components)\n✗ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/` - Backend code (Python/FastAPI)\n✗ `/tests/` - Test files\n✗ `/src/runtime/` - Runtime system code\n\n**When Spawning Development Manager**, provide correct paths:\n\n\n### Process:\n\n**Phase 0: Create Project**\n1. **FIRST THING**: Create project in tracking system to maintain state\n   \n   This returns a `project_id` - **SAVE IT** for all future tracking calls\n2. Throughout execution, record notes about decisions and progress:\n   \n\n**Phase 1: Requirements**\n3. Read user vision, identify core problem/solution\n4. Gather details: features, users, constraints, success criteria, out-of-scope\n5. **BE DECISIVE**: Make reasonable assumptions for missing details - ONLY ask user if requirements are genuinely ambiguous or contradictory\nMissing: technology stack → choose modern, popular defaults (React,