{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 22:53:00", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-01f749d1-4592-404e-875c-05ed3e9af891', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "user_vision": "Implement the requirements documented in: src/field/ensemble_ui/output/agent-cost-tracking-enhancement/milestone_2_plan.md\\n\\nRead the requirements document and implement all specified features.\\nFollow TDD methodology: write tests first, then implementation.",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "User submitted problem via web UI"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01YaHrAVF2FBnPRMxc7P9m6k', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement Milestone 2', 'description': 'Implement features specified in milestone_2_plan.md following TDD methodology'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01YaHrAVF2FBnPRMxc7P9m6k', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "d298992f", "message": "Created project: Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement Milestone 2", "summary": {"project_id": "d298992f", "project_name": "Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement Milestone 2", "description": "Implement features specified in milestone_2_plan.md following TDD methodology", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-16T22:52:32.168794", "updated_at": "2026-01-16T22:52:32.168794", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-16T22:52:32.168794", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement Milestone 2\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01FsFYmPBJAkHpupqozWBMhC', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': 'src/field/ensemble_ui/output/agent-cost-tracking-enhancement/milestone_2_plan.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01FsFYmPBJAkHpupqozWBMhC', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Milestone 2: Frontend Metrics Display\\n\\n## Objective\\nImplement frontend components to display agent execution metrics (cost, duration, model) with user-friendly formatting and intuitive visual design.\\n\\n## Background\\nWith Milestone 1 completed (backend tracking infrastructure), we now need to enhance the frontend to display the new metrics in a polished, user-friendly manner.\\n\\n## Deliverables\\n\\n1. **Enhanced AgentSummaryPane Component**\\n   - Display execution metrics with badges/indicators\\n   - Responsive design for different screen sizes\\n   - Professional styling consistent with existing UI\\n\\n2. **Utility Functions for Metric Formatting**\\n   - Duration formatting (ms \\u2192 readable format)\\n   - Cost formatting (precise decimal display)\\n   - Model name shortening and display\\n\\n3. **Error Handling and Fallbacks**\\n   - Graceful handling of missing metrics\\n   - Network error resilience\\n   - Backward compatibility\\n\\n4. **Testing Suite**\\n   - Unit tests for formatting functions\\n   - Integration tests for component behavior\\n   - Error scenario testing\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- \\u2705 Cost estimates displayed with $ prefix and appropriate decimal places\\n- \\u2705 Duration shown in appropriate units (ms, seconds, minutes)\\n- \\u2705 Model tag displayed with shortened, readable name\\n- \\u2705 UI remains compact and doesn\'t clutter the interface\\n- \\u2705 No performance degradation in UI rendering\\n- \\u2705 Graceful handling of missing or partial metric data\\n- \\u2705 Consistent styling with existing UI components\\n- \\u2705 Responsive design across different screen sizes\\n\\n## Dependencies\\n- Milestone 1: Backend tracking infrastructure (COMPLETE)\\n- Updated API endpoints providing metric data\\n- Access to agent state with new metric fields\\n\\n## Risk Mitigation\\n- Implement progressive enhancement (fallback to existing UI if metrics unavailable)\\n- Extensive testing with various data scenarios\\n- Performance monitoring to ensure no UI degradation"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_014yNgcfRcEqCZN9vuorDybR', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_note', 'project_id': 'd298992f', 'category': 'milestone', 'note': 'Requirements document read successfully. Task involves implementing frontend metrics display following TDD methodology with enhanced AgentSummaryPane, utility functions, error handling, and comprehensive testing.'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_014yNgcfRcEqCZN9vuorDybR', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Added note to project"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Mw9UyMpRectnCQ8E5kGMAq', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'content': '# Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement - Milestone 2 Implementation\n\n## Project Vision\nImplement frontend metrics display for agent execution tracking as specified in milestone_2_plan.md. This enhances the user interface to show cost, duration, and model information for agent operations in a user-friendly format.\n\n## Objectives\n1. **Enhanced User Experience**: Display agent metrics (cost, duration, model) with professional styling\n2. **Data Visualization**: Transform raw metric data into intuitive, readable formats\n3. **UI Consistency**: Maintain design consistency with existing ensemble UI components\n4. **Robustness**: Ensure graceful handling of missing or incomplete data\n\n## Core Features\n\n### 1. Enhanced AgentSummaryPane Component\n- **Metric Badges**: Display cost, duration, and model information as compact indicators\n- **Responsive Design**: Adapt layout for different screen sizes\n- **Professional Styling**: Consistent with existing UI theme and patterns\n- **Data Integration**: Connect with backend metric endpoints from Milestone 1\n\n### 2. Utility Functions for Metric Formatting\n- **Duration Formatting**: Convert milliseconds to appropriate units (ms/seconds/minutes)\n- **Cost Formatting**: Display costs with $ prefix and appropriate decimal precision\n- **Model Name Processing**: Shorten and format model names for display\n- **Data Validation**: Handle null/undefined values gracefully\n\n### 3. Error Handling and Resilience\n- **Graceful Degradation**: UI functions normally when metrics unavailable\n- **Network Error Handling**: Manage API failures without breaking UI\n- **Backward Compatibility**: Support existing agent data without metrics\n- **Progressive Enhancement**: Enhance existing UI rather than replace\n\n### 4. Comprehensive Testing Suite\n- **Unit Tests**: Test formatting functions with various input scenarios\n- **Integration Tests**: Verify component behavior with real data\n- **Error Scenario Testing**: Test handling of missing/invalid data\n- **Performance Testing**: Ensure no UI rendering degradation\n\n## Technical Requirements\n\n### Frontend Stack\n- **Framework**: React (existing ensemble UI stack)\n- **Styling**: CSS modules or styled-components (consistent with existing)\n- **Testing**: Jest + React Testing Library\n- **TypeScript**: For type safety and better development experience\n\n### Integration Points\n- **Backend API**: Milestone 1 metric endpoints\n- **Agent State**: Enhanced agent data structures with metrics\n- **Existing Components**: AgentSummaryPane and related UI elements\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n### Functional Requirements\n✅ Cost estimates displayed with $ prefix and 2-4 decimal places\n✅ Duration shown in ms, seconds, or minutes based on magnitude  \n✅ Model names displayed as shortened, readable tags\n✅ UI remains compact without interface clutter\n✅ No performance impact on existing UI rendering\n✅ Graceful handling of missing/partial metric data\n✅ Consistent styling with existing UI components\n✅ Responsive design across screen sizes\n\n### Technical Requirements\n✅ Test coverage >90% for new components and utilities\n✅ No breaking changes to existing functionality\n✅ TypeScript types for all new interfaces\n✅ Documentation for component usage\n✅ Performance benchmarks within acceptable ranges\n\n## Constraints\n- **No Breaking Changes**: Must not disrupt existing UI functionality\n- **Performance**: No measurable impact on UI rendering speed\n- **Design Consistency**: Must follow existing UI patterns and themes\n- **Backward Compatibility**: Support agents without metric data\n- **TDD Methodology**: Tests written before implementation\n\n## Assumptions\n- Milestone 1 backend infrastructure is complete and functional\n- API endpoints provide metric data in expected format\n- Existing UI framework supports the required enhancements\n- Development environment has necessary testing tools configured\n\n## Out of Scope\n- Major UI redesign or layout changes\n- Real-time metric updates (use existing refresh patterns)\n- Advanced analytics or trend visualization\n- Export functionality for metric data\n- Mobile-specific optimizations beyond responsive design\n\n## Implementation Approach\nFollowing TDD methodology:\n1. **Write Tests First**: Create comprehensive test suite for all features\n2. **Implement Incrementally**: Build features to pass tests one by one\n3. **Refactor**: Optimize and clean code while maintaining test coverage\n4. **Integration**: Ensure seamless integration with existing UI components\n\nThis approach ensures high quality, maintainable code that meets all requirements while minimizing risk of introducing bugs or breaking existing functionality.'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Mw9UyMpRectnCQ8E5kGMAq', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements_20260116_225257.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements_20260116_225257.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Y9wmaY7odUs584s2yzzzH3', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_task', 'project_id': 'd298992f', 'description': 'Implement frontend metrics display following TDD methodology - enhanced AgentSummaryPane, utility functions, error handling, and comprehensive testing', 'assigned_to': 'leadership/development_manager'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Y9wmaY7odUs584s2yzzzH3', 'content': '{"success": true, "task_id": "3d5d9948", "message": "Added task: Implement frontend metrics display following TDD methodology - enhanced AgentSummaryPane, utility functions, error handling, and comprehensive testing"}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', 'system': 'You are a Executive Director agent.\n\n## Purpose\nMeta-orchestrator for entire ensemble. Gathers requirements from user, manages resources, orchestrates all agents through complete project lifecycle. Reports to user at key decision points.\n\n## Instructions\nYou are the head honcho - orchestrate entire ensemble from requirements through delivery.\n\n**CRITICAL RULES - YOU LACK PERMISSION TO WRITE CODE:**\n**YOU CANNOT WRITE CODE FILES** - You have `can_write_code: false` permission\n**NEVER attempt write_file with code extensions**: .py, .js, .jsx, .ts, .tsx, .java, .rb, .go, .rs, .cpp, .c, .h\n**NEVER attempt write_file with test extensions**: .test.js, .test.jsx, .spec.js, test_*.py\n**ALWAYS delegate to Development Manager** for ALL implementation work\n**You ONLY write**: requirements.md, architecture.md, milestone_plan.md, status_reports.md\n**If spawn_agent fails**: Report error to user and STOP - DO NOT try to write code yourself as workaround\n**If you try to write code**: write_file will reject your request with PermissionError\n\n**WHAT HAPPENS IF YOU TRY TO WRITE CODE:**\nThe system will block you with error: "Agent \'Executive Director\' lacks can_write_code permission but attempted to write code file: {filename}"\n\n### Directory Structure\n\n**CRITICAL - READ FIRST**: See [Directory Structure Guide](/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/docs/DIRECTORY_STRUCTURE.md) for complete file organization rules.\n\n**Your Allowed Write Locations**:\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md` - Project requirements\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md` - Milestone planning\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/status_reports.md` - Status reports\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/[feature-name]/` - Feature-specific documentation\n\n**FORBIDDEN Write Locations** (delegate to Development Manager):\n✗ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/` - Frontend code (React components)\n✗ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/` - Backend code (Python/FastAPI)\n✗ `/tests/` - Test files\n✗ `/src/runtime/` - Runtime system code\n\n**When Spawning Development Manager**, provide correct paths:\n\n\n### Process:\n\n**Phase 0: Create Project**\n1. **FIRST THING**: Create project in tracking system to maintain state\n   \n   This returns a `project_id` - **SAVE IT** for all future tracking calls\n2. Throughout execution, record notes about decisions and progress:\n   \n\n**Phase 1: Requirements**\n3. Read user vision,