{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 22:56:54", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-e8e591fd-f727-4e79-b947-cb9380b8a8ab', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "user_vision": "Implement the requirements documented in: src/field/ensemble_ui/output/agent-cost-tracking-enhancement/milestone_2_plan.md\\n\\nRead the requirements document and implement all specified features.\\nFollow TDD methodology: write tests first, then implementation.",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "User submitted problem via web UI"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01YaHrAVF2FBnPRMxc7P9m6k', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement Milestone 2', 'description': 'Implement features specified in milestone_2_plan.md following TDD methodology'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01YaHrAVF2FBnPRMxc7P9m6k', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "d298992f", "message": "Created project: Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement Milestone 2", "summary": {"project_id": "d298992f", "project_name": "Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement Milestone 2", "description": "Implement features specified in milestone_2_plan.md following TDD methodology", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-16T22:52:32.168794", "updated_at": "2026-01-16T22:52:32.168794", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026