5 No performance degradation in UI rendering\\n- \\u2705 Graceful handling of missing or partial metric data\\n- \\u2705 Consistent styling with existing UI components\\n- \\u2705 Responsive design across different screen sizes\\n\\n## Dependencies\\n- Milestone 1: Backend tracking infrastructure (COMPLETE)\\n- Updated API endpoints providing metric data\\n- Access to agent state with new metric fields\\n\\n## Risk Mitigation\\n- Implement progressive enhancement (fallback to existing UI if metrics unavailable)\\n- Extensive testing with various data scenarios\\n- Performance monitoring to ensure no UI degradation"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_014yNgcfRcEqCZN9vuorDybR', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_note', 'project_id': 'd298992f', 'category': 'milestone', 'note': 'Requirements document read successfully. Task involves implementing frontend metrics display following TDD methodology with enhanced AgentSummaryPane, utility functions, error handling, and comprehensive testing.'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_014yNgcfRcEqCZN9vuorDybR', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Added note to project"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Mw9UyMpRectnCQ8E5kGMAq', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'content': '# Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement - Milestone 2 Implementation\n\n## Project Vision\nImplement frontend metrics display for agent execution tracking as specified in milestone_2_plan.md. This enhances the user interface to show cost, duration, and model information for agent operations in a user-friendly format.\n\n## Objectives\n1. **Enhanced User Experience**: Display agent metrics (cost, duration, model) with professional styling\n2. **Data Visualization**: Transform raw metric data into intuitive, readable formats\n3. **UI Consistency**: Maintain design consistency with existing ensemble UI components\n4. **Robustness**: Ensure graceful handling of missing or incomplete data\n\n## Core Features\n\n### 1. Enhanced AgentSummaryPane Component\n- **Metric Badges**: Display cost, duration, and model information as compact indicators\n- **Responsive Design**: Adapt layout for different screen sizes\n- **Professional Styling**: Consistent with existing UI theme and patterns\n- **Data Integration**: Connect with backend metric endpoints from Milestone 1\n\n### 2. Utility Functions for Metric Formatting\n- **Duration Formatting**: Convert milliseconds to appropriate units (ms/seconds/minutes)\n- **Cost Formatting**: Display costs with $ prefix and appropriate decimal precision\n- **Model Name Processing**: Shorten and format model names for display\n- **Data Validation**: Handle null/undefined values gracefully\n\n### 3. Error Handling and Resilience\n- **Graceful Degradation**: UI functions normally when metrics unavailable\n- **Network Error Handling**: Manage API failures without breaking UI\n- **Backward Compatibility**: Support existing agent data without metrics\n- **Progressive Enhancement**: Enhance existing UI rather than replace\n\n### 4. Comprehensive Testing Suite\n- **Unit Tests**: Test formatting functions with various input scenarios\n- **Integration Tests**: Verify component behavior with real data\n- **Error Scenario Testing**: Test handling of missing/invalid data\n- **Performance Testing**: Ensure no UI rendering degradation\n\n## Technical Requirements\n\n### Frontend Stack\n- **Framework**: React (existing ensemble UI stack)\n- **Styling**: CSS modules or styled-components (consistent with existing)\n- **Testing**: Jest + React Testing Library\n- **TypeScript**: For type safety and better development experience\n\n### Integration Points\n- **Backend API**: Milestone 1 metric endpoints\n- **Agent State**: Enhanced agent data structures with metrics\n- **Existing Components**: AgentSummaryPane and related UI elements\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n### Functional Requirements\n✅ Cost estimates displayed with $ prefix and 2-4 decimal places\n✅ Duration shown in ms, seconds, or minutes based on magnitude  \n✅ Model names displayed as shortened, readable tags\n✅ UI remains compact without interface clutter\n✅ No performance impact on existing UI rendering\n✅ Graceful handling of missing/partial metric data\n✅ Consistent styling with existing UI components\n✅ Responsive design across screen sizes\n\n### Technical Requirements\n✅ Test coverage >90% for new components and utilities\n✅ No breaking changes to existing functionality\n✅ TypeScript types for all new interfaces\n✅ Documentation for component usage\n✅ Performance benchmarks within acceptable ranges\n\n## Constraints\n- **No Breaking Changes**: Must not disrupt existing UI functionality\n- **Performance**: No measurable impact on UI rendering speed\n- **Design Consistency**: Must follow existing UI patterns and themes\n- **Backward Compatibility**: Support agents without metric data\n- **TDD Methodology**: Tests written before implementation\n\n## Assumptions\n- Milestone 1 backend infrastructure is complete and functional\n- API endpoints provide metric data in expected format\n- Existing UI framework supports the required enhancements\n- Development environment has necessary testing tools configured\n\n## Out of Scope\n- Major UI redesign or layout changes\n- Real-time metric updates (use existing refresh patterns)\n- Advanced analytics or trend visualization\n- Export functionality for metric data\n- Mobile-specific optimizations beyond responsive design\n\n## Implementation Approach\nFollowing TDD methodology:\n1. **Write Tests First**: Create comprehensive test suite for all features\n2. **Implement Incrementally**: Build features to pass tests one by one\n3. **Refactor**: Optimize and clean code while maintaining test coverage\n4. **Integration**: Ensure seamless integration with existing UI components\n\nThis approach ensures high quality, maintainable code that meets all requirements while minimizing risk of introducing bugs or breaking existing functionality.'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Mw9UyMpRectnCQ8E5kGMAq', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements_20260116_225257.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements_20260116_225257.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Y9wmaY7odUs584s2yzzzH3', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_task', 'project_id': 'd298992f', 'description': 'Implement frontend metrics display following TDD methodology - enhanced AgentSummaryPane, utility functions, error handling, and comprehensive testing', 'assigned_to': 'leadership/development_manager'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Y9wmaY7odUs584s2yzzzH3', 'content': '{"success": true, "task_id": "3d5d9948", "message": "Added task: Implement frontend metrics display following TDD methodology - enhanced AgentSummaryPane, utility functions, error handling, and comprehensive testing"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01BaDGx5PivBub9WT8fTxv76', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/development_manager', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output', 'project_name': 'Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement Milestone 2'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{